  "releaseNotes": "A. The class ProvBratnet has been added. With this class, you can connect with Bratnet Invoicing Provider (eTimologeria).\n\t\n\tB. Class SendInvoices\n\t   - The object bratnetData has been added.\n\t   - The field nationalID has been added to the ExtraDetails object.\n\t   \n\tC. Class myDATATools\n\t   - The method calcInvoiceGrossValue has been added.\n\t   - The method calcInvoiceNetValue has been added.\n\t   - The method calcInvoiceVatAmount has been added.",
